{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.44, "text": "In this town, everyone has a bunker, except me."}, {"start": 4.04, "end": 4.84, "text": "My name is Jake."}, {"start": 5.38, "end": 7.84, "text": "10 years ago, the zombie apocalypse began."}, {"start": 8.34, "end": 10.54, "text": "Every family was given an underground bunker,"}, {"start": 10.9, "end": 12.56, "text": "but no two bunkers were the same."}, {"start": 13.26, "end": 15.64, "text": "Bunker number one was made entirely of glass,"}, {"start": 15.96, "end": 16.96, "text": "deep beneath the ocean."}, {"start": 17.64, "end": 19.64, "text": "Bunker number seven was a luxury mansion"}, {"start": 19.64, "end": 22.58, "text": "with a pool, movie theater, and unlimited food."}, {"start": 23.26, "end": 26.74, "text": "Bunker number 12 had one rule, never make a sound."}, {"start": 26.74, "end": 30.6, "text": "And bunker number 66 had 100 metal doors,"}, {"start": 30.74, "end": 32.82, "text": "but nobody could open the last one."}, {"start": 33.38, "end": 35.64, "text": "Some people lived like kings, but me?"}, {"start": 36.14, "end": 38.24, "text": "I slept inside an abandoned gas station,"}, {"start": 38.6, "end": 40.46, "text": "hiding from zombies every night"}, {"start": 40.46, "end": 42.58, "text": "until I noticed something strange."}, {"start": 43.08, "end": 44.66, "text": "The zombies never attacked me."}, {"start": 44.92, "end": 47.92, "text": "They chased everyone else, but whenever I walked past,"}, {"start": 48.4, "end": 50.72, "text": "they just stopped and stared."}, {"start": 51.34, "end": 53.06, "text": "So one day, I followed them."}, {"start": 53.38, "end": 55.38, "text": "They led me beneath an abandoned hospital"}, {"start": 55.38, "end": 57.34, "text": "to a giant metal door."}, {"start": 57.94, "end": 58.72, "text": "Bunker 100."}, {"start": 59.4, "end": 61.02, "text": "When I touched it, it opened."}, {"start": 61.94, "end": 63.84, "text": "Inside were hundreds of security monitors,"}, {"start": 64.1, "end": 65.72, "text": "showing every bunker in the city,"}, {"start": 66.04, "end": 68.08, "text": "and in the middle was a giant screen."}, {"start": 68.52, "end": 70.32, "text": "It displayed every person's name,"}, {"start": 70.64, "end": 72.76, "text": "but when I searched for mine, nothing."}, {"start": 73.38, "end": 74.92, "text": "Instead, a message appeared."}, {"start": 75.54, "end": 77.06, "text": "Subject zero has returned."}, {"start": 77.76, "end": 79.7, "text": "Suddenly, every screen turned red."}, {"start": 80.08, "end": 81.96, "text": "All bunkers, initiate lockdown."}, {"start": 81.96, "end": 83.2, "text": "I turned around."}, {"start": 83.92, "end": 85.4, "text": "Hundreds of zombies stood behind me,"}, {"start": 85.5, "end": 86.56, "text": "but they weren't attacking."}, {"start": 87.0, "end": 87.64, "text": "They were waiting."}, {"start": 88.2, "end": 89.92, "text": "Then, an old recording appeared,"}, {"start": 90.28, "end": 92.24, "text": "a scientist holding a newborn baby."}, {"start": 92.74, "end": 95.82, "text": "That baby was me, and underneath were the words,"}, {"start": 96.26, "end": 97.5, "text": "the first infected."}, {"start": 97.88, "end": 98.98, "text": "That's when I understood."}, {"start": 99.4, "end": 101.82, "text": "The bunkers weren't built to protect people from zombies."}, {"start": 102.28, "end": 105.0, "text": "They were built to protect everyone from me."}, {"start": 105.4, "end": 107.32, "text": "And for the first time in 10 years,"}, {"start": 107.7, "end": 109.28, "text": "every zombie bowed down."}, {"start": 109.28, "end": 111.58, "text": "But suddenly, another message appeared."}, {"start": 112.18, "end": 113.9, "text": "Subject zero has been activated."}, {"start": 114.4, "end": 115.24, "text": "A countdown began."}, {"start": 115.78, "end": 117.6, "text": "Ten, nine, eight."}, {"start": 118.24, "end": 120.66, "text": "Then, every bunker door in the city started opening,"}, {"start": 121.06, "end": 121.94, "text": "and a voice whispered,"}, {"start": 122.56, "end": 123.76, "text": "phase two has begun."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.18}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.18, "e": 0.36}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.36, "e": 0.7}, {"w": "everyone", "s": 1.22, "e": 1.44}, {"w": "has", "s": 1.44, "e": 1.82}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.82, "e": 2.3}, {"w": "bunker,", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.3}, {"w": "except", "s": 2.82, "e": 3.08}, {"w": "me.", "s": 3.08, "e": 3.44}, {"w": "My", "s": 4.04, "e": 4.06}, {"w": "name", "s": 4.06, "e": 4.28}, {"w": "is", "s": 4.28, "e": 4.66}, {"w": "Jake.", "s": 4.66, "e": 4.84}, {"w": "10", "s": 5.38, "e": 5.54}, {"w": "years", "s": 5.54, "e": 5.76}, {"w": "ago,", "s": 5.76, "e": 6.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.32, "e": 6.42}, {"w": "zombie", "s": 6.42, "e": 6.78}, {"w": "apocalypse", "s": 6.78, "e": 7.34}, {"w": "began.", "s": 7.34, "e": 7.84}, {"w": "Every", "s": 8.34, "e": 8.6}, {"w": "family", "s": 8.6, "e": 8.94}, {"w": "was", "s": 8.94, "e": 9.24}, {"w": "given", "s": 9.24, "e": 9.42}, {"w": "an", "s": 9.42, "e": 9.64}, {"w": "underground", "s": 9.64, "e": 10.08}, {"w": "bunker,", "s": 10.08, "e": 10.54}, {"w": "but", "s": 10.9, "e": 11.06}, {"w": "no", "s": 11.06, "e": 11.34}, {"w": "two", "s": 11.34, "e": 11.58}, {"w": "bunkers", "s": 11.58, "e": 11.98}, {"w": "were", "s": 11.98, "e": 12.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 12.16, "e": 12.3}, {"w": "same.", "s": 12.3, "e": 12.56}, {"w": "Bunker", "s": 13.26, "e": 13.26}, {"w": "number", "s": 13.26, "e": 13.48}, {"w": "one", "s": 13.48, "e": 13.88}, {"w": "was", "s": 13.88, "e": 14.1}, {"w": "made", "s": 14.1, "e": 14.32}, {"w": "entirely", "s": 14.32, "e": 14.9}, {"w": "of", "s": 14.9, "e": 15.22}, {"w": "glass,", "s": 15.22, "e": 15.64}, {"w": "deep", "s": 15.96, "e": 16.12}, {"w": "beneath", "s": 16.12, "e": 16.46}, {"w": "the", "s": 16.46, "e": 16.7}, {"w": "ocean.", "s": 16.7, "e": 16.96}, {"w": "Bunker", "s": 17.64, "e": 17.64}, {"w": "number", "s": 17.64, "e": 17.92}, {"w": "seven", "s": 17.92, "e": 18.38}, {"w": 